      "refersTo": "reader-toolbar",
      "description": "Project switching and close above the full-viewport chapter reader.",
      "html": "<header class=\"ds-toolbar\"><button class=\"ds-close\" aria-label=\"Zavrieť príbeh\">×</button><span>Štýlový chlpáč</span><div class=\"ds-switch\"><span>1 / 6</span><button aria-label=\"Predchádzajúci projekt\">←</button><button aria-label=\"Ďalší projekt\">→</button></div></header>",
      "css": ".ds-toolbar{font-family:Instrument,Arial,sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;height:76px;padding:0 24px;background:#07140de8;color:#c9edb6;border-bottom:1px solid var(--signal-edge,#35552d);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);font-size:12px}.ds-toolbar button{font-family:Instrument,Arial,sans-serif;border-radius:0;min-height:44px;background:none;color:inherit;cursor:pointer}.ds-close{border:0;font-size:22px;padding:0 8px}.ds-switch{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}.ds-switch span{font-size:11px;margin-right:15px}.ds-switch button{width:44px;border:1px solid #50713c;font-size:20px;color:var(--signal-green,#a4ff61)}.ds-toolbar button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--signal-green,#a4ff61);outline-offset:6px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Evidence view choice",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "evidence-choice",
      "description": "Screenshot-view selector with explicit selected state.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-choice\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Web na počítači</button>",
      "css": ".ds-choice{font-family:Instrument,Arial,sans-serif;min-height:46px;padding:11px 20px;border:1px solid var(--signal-edge,#35552d);border-radius:0;background:transparent;color:#c7e7b6;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer}.ds-choice:hover{background:#d0f3df;border-color:#d0f3df}.ds-choice[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{background:var(--signal-green,#a4ff61);color:#071009}.ds-choice:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--signal-green,#a4ff61);outline-offset:6px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Copy email action",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "contact-button",
      "description": "Contact action without a form or submission flow.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-copy\">Skopírovať e-mail ↗</button>",
      "css": ".ds-copy{font-family:Instrument,Arial,sans-serif;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:48px;padding:12px 18px;border:0;border-radius:0;background:#9fee64;color:#051005;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .3s,background .3s}.ds-copy:hover{transform:translateY(-3px)}.ds-copy:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--signal-green,#a4ff61);outline-offset:6px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Background pause",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Freezes autonomous WebGL drift; scroll travel remains available.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-pause\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Pozastaviť pozadie</button>",
      "css": ".ds-pause{font-family:Instrument,Arial,sans-serif;padding:12px 5px;background:none;border:0;color:#92be7d;font-size:10px;text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer}.ds-pause:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--signal-green,#a4ff61);outline-offset:6px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Projected project beacon",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "beacon",
      "description": "Invisible native hit area centered on projected crystal geometry; the panel preview omits the WebGL mesh.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-beacon\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Zobraziť projekt Štýlový chlpáč\"><span class=\"ds-brackets\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"ds-name\">Štýlový chlpáč</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-beacon{font-family:Instrument,Arial,sans-serif;position:relative;width:130px;height:140px;padding:0;background:transparent;border:0;color:#c2f9a5;cursor:pointer}.ds-name{position:absolute;top:116px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);white-space:nowrap;font-size:10px}.ds-brackets{position:absolute;inset:8px}.ds-brackets::before,.ds-brackets::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;width:13px;height:13px;border:1px solid #b2ff85;opacity:.75;transition:opacity .2s,transform .2s}.ds-brackets::before{left:0;top:0;border-width:1px 0 0 1px}.ds-brackets::after{right:0;bottom:0;border-width:0 1px 1px 0}.ds-beacon:hover .ds-brackets::before{transform:translate(-6px,-6px)}.ds-beacon:hover .ds-brackets::after{transform:translate(6px,6px)}.ds-beacon:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--signal-green,#a4ff61);outline-offset:6px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Project hologram",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "hologram",
      "description": "Native project summary shown after reveal; its explicit story link triggers laser entry.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-hologram\"><h2>Štýlový chlpáč</h2><p class=\"ds-kind\">Web · skutočná prevádzka</p><p>Web, rezervácie a správa salónu.</p><a class=\"ds-holo-open\" href=\"#projekt/stylovy-chlpac\">Otvoriť príbeh <span>↗</span></a><button class=\"ds-holo-dismiss\" aria-label=\"Zavrieť náhľad\">×</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-hologram{font-family:Instrument,Arial,sans-serif;position:relative;width:270px;padding:25px 25px 20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#163e26e8,#071b12ed);border:1px solid #80fca28c;color:#dcffe2;backdrop-filter:blur(12px)}.ds-hologram::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:-5px 13px 5px -5px;border-left:1px solid #a3ffb866;border-top:1px solid #a3ffb866;pointer-events:none}.ds-hologram::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:31%;height:1px;background:#adffbe44;pointer-events:none}.ds-hologram h2{font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.03em;max-width:15ch;color:#d6ffda;margin:0}.ds-hologram p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.65;color:#c0d9bf;margin:0}.ds-hologram .ds-kind{font-size:10px;color:#96dfaa;margin:11px 0}.ds-holo-open{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:32px;border-bottom:1px solid #71b54d;padding:14px 0;color:#caffad;font-size:13px;min-height:48px;text-decoration:none}.ds-holo-open:hover{color:#fff;border-color:#c4ffba}.ds-holo-dismiss{font-family:Instrument,Arial,sans-serif;position:absolute;top:5px;right:5px;background:transparent;border:0;color:#b0f6bf;width:32px;height:32px;font-size:20px;cursor:pointer}.ds-hologram a:focus-visible,.ds-hologram button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--signal-green,#a4ff61);outline-offset:6px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Reader panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "reader-panel",
      "description": "Stable HTML reading surface for a full actual chapter, with internal overflow.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-reader-panel\"><p class=\"ds-kicker\">01 / Potreba</p><h3>Od potreby k riešeniu.</h3><p>Text skutočnej kapitoly zostáva v HTML spolu s prílohami, ukážkami a zdrojmi, ktoré do nej patria.</p></article>",
      "css": ".ds-reader-panel{font-family:Instrument,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:526px;max-height:70vh;overflow-y:auto;padding:30px 32px;background:linear-gradient(130deg,#0d281be8,#07160feb);border:1px solid #6cc78a77;color:#dcf5df;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:#557c57 #07160f}.ds-reader-panel h3{font-size:clamp(30px,3vw,43px);font-weight:700;line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:0}.ds-reader-panel p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#bdd6bd;margin:22px 0 0}.ds-reader-panel .ds-kicker{font-size:10px;color:#a4e6b4;margin:0 0 17px}.ds-reader-panel a:focus-visible,.ds-reader-panel button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--signal-green,#a4ff61);outline-offset:6px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Chapter index",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "reader-index",
      "description": "Native buttons move within the current story; the toolbar separately switches projects.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-reader-index\" aria-label=\"Časti príbehu\"><button aria-label=\"Projekt\" aria-current=\"step\">01</button><button aria-label=\"Potreba\">02</button><button aria-label=\"Výsledok a podklady\">03</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-reader-index{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap}.ds-reader-index button{font-family:Instrument,Arial,sans-serif;width:36px;height:40px;background:#0b2115b3;border:1px solid #4d835d;color:#8fc39b;font-size:11px;cursor:pointer}.ds-reader-index button[aria-current=\"step\"]{background:#a4ffb9;color:#06100a;border-color:#a4ffb9}.ds-reader-index button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--signal-green,#a4ff61);outline-offset:6px;}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Na konci internetu",
    "overview": "“Na konci internetu” begins with one large crystal assembled from the six actual project pieces. First scroll fractures it into those six projects; reverse scroll reassembles it. A compact green camera flight then makes one project primary while smaller pieces establish depth. Procedural fog, a faint axis and sparse debris connect the whole journey.\n\nNative HTML holograms make the 3D projects readable. The story action sends a brief laser into its project, produces an impact and burst, and enters a chapter journey over the same world. Each real content section has its own 3D fragment and stable reading panel. Source text, evidence captures and links stay in HTML rather than being replaced by decorative chapter summaries.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "One large crystal reversibly separates into the six actual project pieces.",
      "A primary project, smaller surrounding fragments and readable HTML holograms.",
      "A brief laser, impact and fragment burst connects a project to its story.",
      "Real article sections become fragment stops with stable, scrollable reading panels.",
      "Native chapter buttons, toolbar project switching and exact main-position return.",
      "One green world, the fine-pointer target cursor and original-content fallback."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Continuous World Rule",
        "body": "Keep the flight, hologram and article within one green atmosphere; preserve the world behind the reading surface.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Reading Lock Rule",
        "body": "Freeze the main flight while the hologram or story is open. Within a story, move only its chapter camera from chapter scroll and keep the current reading panel stable during the reading interval.",
        "section": "elevation"
      },
      {
        "name": "The HTML Evidence Rule",
        "body": "Keep project names, summaries, article links, states and evidence in semantic HTML independently of the WebGL geometry.",
        "section": "typography"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** build the opening crystal from the six actual project pieces and keep fracture reversible.",
      "**Do** keep the native hologram link as the explicit trigger for laser entry.",
      "**Do** derive chapter stops from the full original content and retain evidence and source links.",
      "**Do** keep a stable reading interval, internal overflow and native chapter buttons.",
      "**Do** preserve exact main-flight return and original-content WebGL fallback."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** replace real article sections with decorative one-line summaries.",
      "**Don't** confuse chapter navigation with toolbar switching between projects.",
      "**Don't** make the main flight drift while a hologram or story is open.",
      "**Don't** add a video-service or audio dependency to the laser interaction.",
      "**Don't** remove the fallback article or the original evidence distinctions."
    ]
  }
}
